{"id":"striscia","lemma":"striscia","pos":"noun","rank":4785,"glosses":["strip, band, stripe, trail, line, streak","zebra crossing, pedestrian crossing, crosswalk","the markings of a parking spot and, by metonymy, the parking spot itself. If blu (“blue”), it means paid parking; if bianche (“white”), it means free parking; if gialle (“yellow”), it means disabled or otherwise restricted parking."],"ipa":"/ˈstriʃ.ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"strisce"},"examples":[{"text":"Taglia la carne a strisce.","en":"Cut the meat into strips.","words":[{"g":"size"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meat, flesh"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Perché le zebre hanno le strisce?","en":"Why do zebras have stripes?","words":[{"g":"why / because"},{"g":"the / to her"},{"g":"zebra","l":"zebra"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]},{"text":"Le strisce erano orizzontali.","en":"The stripes were horizontal.","words":[{"g":"the / to her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"horizontal","l":"orizzontale"}]},{"text":"Tagliate la carne a strisce.","en":"Cut the meat into strips.","words":[{"g":"to cut, to slash","l":"tagliare"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meat, flesh"},{"g":"to / at"},null]},{"text":"Tagli la carne a strisce.","en":"Cut the meat into strips.","words":[{"g":"cut","l":"taglio"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meat, flesh"},{"g":"to / at"},null]}]}